<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Welcome to the Mashar Alumni Network – Activate Your Account</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #F0F2F5;
            color: #1A1A2E;
            padding: 40px 16px;
        }

        .email-wrapper {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
            border: 1px solid #E1E5ED;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }

        .top-accent {
            height: 5px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #F5A623 0%, #F7B733 100%);
            border-radius: 10px 10px 0 0;
        }

        .email-header {
            background-color: #1A237E;
            padding: 32px 40px 28px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .brand-logo {
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 0.25em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #F5A623;
            margin-bottom: 14px;
        }

        .header-title {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #FFFFFF;
            line-height: 1.3;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .header-subtitle {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #B0B8E8;
        }

        .email-body {
            background-color: #FFFFFF;
            padding: 40px 40px 36px;
        }

        .greeting {
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #333;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .greeting strong {
            color: #1A237E;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .body-text {
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.75;
            color: #555;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .cta-wrap {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 15px 0 15px;
        }

        .cta-btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #1A237E;
            color: #FFFFFF;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 600;
            padding: 15px 40px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            letter-spacing: 0.02em;
        }

        .signature {
            padding-top: 24px;
            border-top: 1px solid #EAECF5;
            margin-top: 24px;
        }

        .sig-warm {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #888;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        .sig-name {
            font-size: 17px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #1A237E;
        }

        .sig-role {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #AAA;
            letter-spacing: 0.06em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-top: 3px;
        }

        .email-footer {
            background-color: #1A237E;
            border-radius: 0 0 10px 10px;
            padding: 24px 40px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .footer-note {
            font-size: 11px;
            color: #B0B8E8;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        .footer-note a {
            color: #F5A623;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        @media (max-width: 480px) {

            .email-header,
            .email-body {
                padding: 28px 24px;
            }

            .header-title {
                font-size: 20px;
            }

            .email-footer {
                padding: 20px 24px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="email-wrapper">
        <div class="top-accent"></div>
        <div class="email-header">
            <div class="brand-logo">Mashar Alumni Network</div>
            <h1 class="header-title">Account Approved</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="email-body">
            <p class="greeting">Dear <strong>
                    <%= full_name.split(' ')[0] %></strong>,</p>

        <h2 style="font-size:16px;margin:8px 0 12px;color:#1A237E;">Congratulations and welcome to the Mashar Alumni Network.</h2>

        <p class="body-text">We are pleased to let you know that your alumni application has been successfully verified. Your account is now ready.</p>

        <div class="cta-wrap">
            <a href="<%= url %>" class="cta-btn" style="color: #FFFFFF;">Complete Account Setup</a>
        </div>

        <p class="body-text"><strong>What You' ll Gain Access To</strong>
            </p>
            <ul style="color:#555; margin:0 0 18px 20px; line-height:1.7;">
                <li>Complete your professional alumni profile.</li>
                <li>Connect with fellow Mashar alumni across the world.</li>
                <li>Access exclusive resources, recordings, and learning materials.</li>
                <li>Register for alumni events, webinars, and peer learning sessions.</li>
                <li>Stay informed about opportunities, initiatives, and future programs.</li>
            </ul>

            <p class="body-text"><strong>Before You Begin</strong><br />Take a few moments to complete your profile
                accurately. A complete profile helps fellow alumni connect with you and allows us to tailor
                opportunities that are most relevant to your experience and interests.</p>

            <div class="signature">
                <p class="sig-warm">We are delighted to welcome you into a community committed to continuous learning,
                    meaningful connection, and leadership that creates positive impact.</p>
                <div class="sig-name">Mashar Team</div>
                <div class="sig-role">Mashar Coaching · Training · Consultancy</div>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-top:18px;font-size:13px;color:#666;">
                <p style="margin:6px 0">🌐 <a href="https://www.mashar.org/"
                        style="color:#F5A623;text-decoration:none;">www.mashar.org</a></p>
                <p style="margin:6px 0">📧 team@mashar.org</p>
                <p style="margin:6px 0">📱 +1 (613) 261-3210 (WhatsApp)</p>
                <p style="margin:6px 0">Follow us: <a href="#" style="color:#F5A623;text-decoration:none;">LinkedIn</a>
                    | <a href="#" style="color:#F5A623;text-decoration:none;">Instagram</a></p>
            </div>

            <p class="body-text" style="font-size:12px;color:#777;margin-top:14px;">For security purposes, this
                activation link will expire after <strong>7 days</strong>. If it expires, simply request a new
                activation email from the login page.
                <br />For assistance, or if you were not expecting this email, please contact us immediately at
                <strong>team@mashar.org</strong>.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="email-footer">
            <p class="footer-note">
                © <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Mashar Alumni System. All rights reserved.<br>
                    <a href="https://mashar.org/">mashar.org</a>
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>

</html>